; Thermo: holiday plan, multi-day vacation and season frames (OWNd PR #97, review item 2).
; Question: do the gateways accept the forms the PR decodes, and what goes on the bus?
; The PR reads the parameter after 115# / 215# / 13DDD# / 23DDD# / 33DDD# as the weekly
; program to resume (1102 -> program 2), not as a temperature. The bus telegram shows
; whether the translator emits a program byte or a temperature byte for it. Frames the
; PR description quotes as replayed are listed first; the rest are their neighbours,
; so a difference between two rows can be read from the bytes.
;
; Not answered here: what a central unit reports while a holiday or vacation runs
; (review item 3). That is the central unit's behaviour, not the gateway's, and needs
; a capture from a plant.

